  "scope": "Coincentration block records and countdown access, Roulette Model calls, Snowball collision names and variant query.",
  "changes": [
    "Coincentration: replace four block shadow types with the real 40-element mBlocks record; name animTimer, visible, active and animFrame.",
    "Coincentration: replace out-of-bounds indexing from mSparkles[31].y with mCountdown/mPhase, including a native countdown decrement; name drawing coordinates, sprite index and priority.",
