    "runtime_validation": "No new emulator run: names follow explicit arithmetic, typed record offsets, state-dispatch guards and existing model virtual slots. No new dynamic behavior claim.",
    "retained_constraints": [
      "Keep Snowball high-offset pointer expressions, collision Vec2 lifetime, separate sample copies and zero-valued frame locals.",
      "Keep Roulette flat Matrix4x3 block copies and its local state PMF view; no claim that the slider class identity is recovered.",
